	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Coffee Along the Douro]]></title>
		<link>https://harbourlight.example/2023/11/05/coffee-along-the-douro/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[tomreed]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Porto wakes up late, but its cafés do not.

We started at a counter near São Bento, where the espresso costs less than a tram ticket.
The owner has run it since 1987.

<h2>Our three favourites</h2>

<ul>
<li>Café Majestic, for the ceiling</li>
<li>Combi Coffee, for the beans</li>
</ul>

<img src="https://harbourlight.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/pasteis-de-nata.png" alt="Custard tarts" />

<!--more-->

<blockquote>Bica is not espresso. Do not argue.</blockquote>

<hr />

Read our <a href="https://harbourlight.example/2024/03/18/a-weekend-in-lisbon/">Lisbon guide</a> next.]]></content:encoded>
